---
/**
 * CLAUDE.md: "Draft freely, but flag every place where you wrote words he hasn't
 * approved." This marks copy I wrote or edited. Tyler either approves it (remove
 * the wrapper) or rewrites it. Nothing here is fact-bearing — no metrics, no
 * outcomes, no dates. Those live in [NEEDS] slots instead.
 */
---

<span class="draft" data-draft><slot /></span>

<style>
  .draft {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-signal) 55%, transparent);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }

  /* At headline scale a dotted rule under every line reads as decoration and
     fights the type. Same signal, much quieter. */
  :is(h1, h2, h3) .draft {
    border-bottom-width: 1px;
    border-bottom-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-signal) 22%, transparent);
    padding-bottom: 0.06em;
  }
</style>
